• Lead projects end to end as an epic owner - design, coordination and delivery, not just implementation. &nbsp;

• Carry a full share of the operational load: weekly first-responder duty and participation in our 24/7 Jamf Trust rota, diagnosing production issues and turning firefights into permanent fixes. &nbsp;

• Act as a force multiplier in a heavily agent-assisted team - pull requests merge on a single human approval, so keeping review throughput healthy and raising the shared quality bar matters as much as your own output. &nbsp;

• Build broad, working knowledge across the whole product surface: macOS and iOS apps, both distribution channels, content filtering, the ZTNA client, shared packages, and test/release infrastructure. &nbsp;

• Contribute to technical direction alongside the other seniors - proposing work, challenging designs, spotting what's missing from the plan. &nbsp;

• Improve how the team diagnoses its own product: logging, diagnostics, observability and alerting. &nbsp;

• Raise the verification standard, especially in agent-authored code, so tests make delegation safe rather than risky. &nbsp;

• Mentor less experienced engineers - pairing, reviewing with explanation, and deliberately growing people on Apple platform and domain expertise. &nbsp;

